---
title: Order lifecycle state machine (OrderStateMachine)
---
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> CREATED: POST /orders (202)
  CREATED --> VALIDATED: VALIDATION_PASSED
  CREATED --> REJECTED: VALIDATION_FAILED
  CREATED --> CANCELLED: CANCEL_REQUESTED
  VALIDATED --> INVENTORY_RESERVED: RESERVATION_SUCCEEDED
  VALIDATED --> REJECTED: RESERVATION_FAILED
  VALIDATED --> CANCELLED: CANCEL_REQUESTED
  VALIDATED --> FAILED: RESERVATION_EXPIRED
  INVENTORY_RESERVED --> CONFIRMED: CONFIRM
  INVENTORY_RESERVED --> COMPENSATION_PENDING: CANCEL_REQUESTED
  INVENTORY_RESERVED --> FAILED: RESERVATION_EXPIRED
  CONFIRMED --> FULFILLED: FULFILLMENT_COMPLETED
  CONFIRMED --> COMPENSATION_PENDING: FULFILLMENT_FAILED or CANCEL_REQUESTED
  COMPENSATION_PENDING --> CANCELLED: RELEASED_AFTER_CANCELLATION
  COMPENSATION_PENDING --> FAILED: RELEASED_AFTER_FAILURE
  note left of FAILED
    SAGA_EXHAUSTED: any non-terminal
    status can go to FAILED
  end note
  FULFILLED --> [*]
  REJECTED --> [*]
  CANCELLED --> [*]
  FAILED --> [*]
  note right of COMPENSATION_PENDING
    ReleaseInventory command sent.
    Retries exhausted: stays here,
    saga NEEDS_ATTENTION.
  end note
